#: src/Modules/Stock/StockModule.php:109
msgid "Switch it on per product in the inventory tab. Business customers then see and buy from that stock, with its own backorder setting; orders recorded as business orders reduce it and get it back on cancellation and refund. Low and out-of-stock e-mails follow WooCommerce's settings. WooCommerce's \"Hide out of stock items from the catalog\" still uses the normal stock."
